This repository contains the Liftory plugin for AI assistants: its manifests, its skills and its documentation
(the "Plugin"). The Plugin connects an assistant to the Liftory service at https://mcp.liftory.ch/mcp and is only
useful with a Liftory account.

You may download, install and use the Plugin, unmodified, in an assistant of your choice, to use the Liftory
service with your own Liftory account, under Liftory's Terms of Service (https://liftory.ch/terms) and Privacy
